==== Wave 5: Graphics

The heavy wave's visual needs: night lighting (most long-haul is dark), weather that gives the operation teeth, and low-visibility presentation for the minimums arrivals. The foundational toolset stays in play.

The visual stack from Waves 0-1 — Bay's Lighting Mod for the night, X-Clouds Enhancer and BAAC for low-visibility weather presentation — already serves this wave and stays in play. Anything further you add belongs here.

